Risks Relating to Our Industry
Charter hire rates for dry bulk vessels are cyclical and volatile and the dry bulk market remains significantly below its historic high. This may adversely
affect our business, operating results, cash flows, and financial condition.
The volatility in the dry bulk charter market, from which we derive substantially all of our revenues, has affected the dry bulk
